  table { border-collapse: collapse; margin: 12px 0; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 6px 12px; text-align: left; }
  th { background: #f4f6f7; }
  .metric { margin: 4px 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>Order Summary</h1>

<h2>Overview</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Total Orders:</strong> 27</li>
  <li><strong>Date Range:</strong> September 2 – September 4, 2026</li>
</ul>

<h2>Order Status</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>Status</th><th>Count</th><th>Total Revenue</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Confirmed</td><td>24</td><td>$1,901</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Cancelled</td><td>3</td><td>$186</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>Customer Breakdown</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>Customer</th><th>Orders</th><th>Spent (Confirmed)</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Maya Chen</td><td>7 (2 cancelled)</td><td>$477</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Evan Parker</td><td>4</td><td>$276</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Alicia Morgan</td><td>2</td><td>$137</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Sofia Ramirez</td><td>1</td><td>$120</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Nina Patel</td><td>1</td><td>$62</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Jordan Alvarez</td><td>1 (cancelled)</td><td>$0</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Anonymous users (user_*)</td><td>11</td><td>$829</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>Key Metrics</h2>
<p class="metric"><strong>Total Confirmed Revenue:</strong> $1,901</p>
<p class="metric"><strong>Average Order Value (confirmed):</strong> ~$79.21</p>
<p class="metric"><strong>Most Active Customer:</strong> Maya Chen (5 confirmed + 2 cancelled)</p>
<p class="metric"><strong>Highest Single Order:</strong> ORD-CCC96C — Maya Chen — $201 (LogiTech Mouse, OXO Mixing Bowls, Aurora Desk Lamp)</p>
<p class="metric"><strong>Lowest Single Order:</strong> ORD-D256C0 — $14 (AeroLoop Silicone Cable Organizer)</p>

<h2>Top Products (by frequency)</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>#</th><th>Product</th><th>Appearances</th></tr>
  <tr><td>1</td><td>LogiTech Wireless Mouse M310</td><td>15</td></tr>
  <tr><td>2</td><td>OXO SoftWorks 3-Piece Mixing Bowl Set</td><td>8</td></tr>
